>` in `harness_compatibility.json` (status/date/notes) and regenerate with `uv run --script scripts/generate_harness_compatibility.py`\\n</div>\\n\\n## Definition Of Done\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAll four harness entries `verified` in the table, plugin installs and one representative skill executes end-to-end on each, no unresolved token reaching a shell outside claude-code.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"eb46c80c335d30ef2a1b969b4548443558fbf5798866f1f36f48b7881fab12d8\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABUI3ohw\"}"}